<div class="rte-content">
    <h3>Need to Know Where to Vote on Election Day?</h3>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;">Use the <a rel="noopener" href="https://okvoterportal.okelections.us/" target="_blank" title="Precinct Locator/Online Voter Tool">OK Voter Portal</a> to find your polling location. You can also find a list of polling locations for the next election <a href="/media/11paoll2/polling-place-list_110326.pdf" title="here">here</a><a rel="noopener" href="/media/pjmlli3z/media-list_2026_tbd.pdf" target="_blank" title="Polling Place List TBD"></a>.</p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><strong>2026 Archived Polling Locations</strong></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/lhnnlvx3/media-list-february-2026.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_February 10">February</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/xczdazb3/polling-place-list_april-2026.pdf" target="_blank" title="Polling Place List_April 2026">April</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/iaopl5im/polling-place-list_june-2026_v2.pdf" target="_blank" title="Polling Place List June 2026">June</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/c2hdrr4s/pollling-place-list_august-2026.pdf" target="_blank" title="Polling Place List_August 2026">August</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><strong>2025 Archived Polling Locations</strong></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/4umhicpn/media-list_february-2025.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List Feb 2025">February</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/4ltbsyrh/medialist_02042025.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_Mar 4_02042025">March</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/w1lh0bnv/media-list_april-2025.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List for April 2025">April</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/v0vmdrx5/media-list_may-2025.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List for May 2025">May</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/34hhw4m4/media-list_june-10-2025.pdf" target="_blank" title="June 2025 Polling Locations">June</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/5iihgjgp/media-list_sept-9-2025.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List - Sept 9">September</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><strong>2024 Archived Polling Locations</strong></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/ti1laq0t/media-list_february.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_February">February</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/otdbpdh2/media-list_march.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_March">March</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/xscnkipd/media-list_april.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_April">April</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/42ibabdk/media-list_june.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_June">June</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/wfng005f/media-list_august.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List_August">August</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a rel="noopener" href="/media/t3klvt1y/media-list-november.pdf" target="_blank" title="Media List for November">November</a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"> </p>
